        "https://feedops.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/How-Google-Shopping-Title-Optimization-Impacts-Performance_.png",

"https://feedops.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Google-Shopping-Title-Best-Practices_.png"

